{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LkMfWEJTtLHonzAy7DsHQG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"WA EV Network Synergy Horizon Power charger app payment price per kWh\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"synergy.net.au CONSTRUCTION NOTICE LETTER\",\"url\":\"https://www.northam.wa.gov.au/Profiles/northam/Assets/ClientData/News/EV_NETWORK/Northam_-_WA_EV_Network_-_Letter_to_Residents_or_Business_Owners.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"WA EV Network Construction Phase FAQs Overview\",\"url\":\"https://www.northam.wa.gov.au/Profiles/northam/Assets/ClientData/News/EV_NETWORK/WA_EV_Network_Construction_FAQs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Electricity fees & charges - Horizon Power\",\"url\":\"https://www.horizonpower.com.au/utilities/pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Western Australia Electricity Rates 2026-27: Synergy Prices\",\"url\":\"https://wattnavi.com/electricity/rates/wa\"},{\"title\":\"Cheapest Electricity Provider in WA - BLUETTI AU\",\"url\":\"https://www.bluettipower.com.au/blogs/buying-guide/cheapest-electricity-provider-in-wa\"},{\"title\":\"Battery Rebate WA 2026: Synergy $1,300, Horizon $3,800\",\"url\":\"https://missiongreen.com.au/battery-rebate-wa\"},{\"title\":\"Home EV Charging: Costs, Savings, and Smart Tips\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargingwa.com.au/blog/home-ev-charging-cost/\"},{\"title\":\"Is a Home EV Charger Worth It in WA? (Cost & ROI Guide) - Electric Vehicle Charging Installations\",\"url\":\"https://evci.com.au/is-a-home-ev-charger-worth-it-in-wa/\"},{\"title\":\"Horizon Power\",\"url\":\"https://www.horizonpower.com.au/about-us/news-announcements/fees-and-charges-2025/\"},{\"title\":\"Synergy's Midday Saver Tariff: Home Batteries Can Pay in WA\",\"url\":\"https://www.solarquotes.com.au/blog/synergy-midday-saver-review/\"}]\n\nWA EV Network chargers cost **$0.60/kWh on DC fast chargers and $0.35/kWh on AC chargers**. You can pay with the Chargefox app, a credit card or an RFID card.\n\n**Pricing**\n- Horizon Power's current fees page gives the WA EV Network rates as AC Charger 0.35 cents/kWh, DC Charger 0.60 cents/kWh; Idle fee: not applicable (AC) / $1 per minute* once 100% charged (DC). The page says \"cents/kWh\", but that looks like a typo. It should be dollars, which matches the Synergy FAQ below.\n- Horizon Power's 2025 price notice says these fees were \"2025/26 Unchanged from last year\".\n- A Synergy/Shire of Northam FAQ from about 2024 said: \"For Synergy chargers, the price for the DC fast chargers will be $0.60p/Kwh and for the AC slow charger it will be $0.35p/Kwh.\" At that point the rate applied only to the South West grid (SWIS). Horizon Power were still working out pricing for the North West grid (NWIS). Horizon's page now lists the same rates.\n\n**How to pay**\n- Horizon Power: \"You'll be able to pay via the Chargefox app or credit card.\"\n- A Synergy construction notice for the Northam site lists \"Credit Card, RFI Card & Charge Phone App\" as payment options. The site has 1 × 150 kW DC charger and 1 × 22 kW AC charger.\n\n**Background**\n- The WA EV Network is a State Government initiative delivered by Synergy and Horizon Power. It is part of the State Government's $24.4 million Electric Vehicle Fund.\n\n**Gaps**\n- I didn't find any 2026/27 price update for the network. The newest pricing source is Horizon's fees page, indexed about 6 months ago.\n- None of the results came from Synergy's own current EV network page.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c59389d-e35a-4c8f-bb09-2fcfce2e7e03","uuid":"1450ff4a-3f0a-4655-af0a-73170be61fb5","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:30:11.130Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"WA EV Network Synergy Horizon Power charger app payment price per kWh","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01KLng27wwrfsGPLqSrZtLkh","content":[{"title":"synergy.net.au CONSTRUCTION NOTICE LETTER","url":"https://www.northam.wa.gov.au/Profiles/northam/Assets/ClientData/News/EV_NETWORK/Northam_-_WA_EV_Network_-_Letter_to_Residents_or_Business_Owners.pdf"},{"title":"WA EV Network Construction Phase FAQs Overview","url":"https://www.northam.wa.gov.au/Profiles/northam/Assets/ClientData/News/EV_NETWORK/WA_EV_Network_Construction_FAQs.pdf"},{"title":"Electricity fees & charges - Horizon Power","url":"https://www.horizonpower.com.au/utilities/pricing/"},{"title":"Western Australia Electricity Rates 2026-27: Synergy Prices","url":"https://wattnavi.com/electricity/rates/wa"},{"title":"Cheapest Electricity Provider in WA - BLUETTI AU","url":"https://www.bluettipower.com.au/blogs/buying-guide/cheapest-electricity-provider-in-wa"},{"title":"Battery Rebate WA 2026: Synergy $1,300, Horizon $3,800","url":"https://missiongreen.com.au/battery-rebate-wa"},{"title":"Home EV Charging: Costs, Savings, and Smart Tips","url":"https://www.chargingwa.com.au/blog/home-ev-charging-cost/"},{"title":"Is a Home EV Charger Worth It in WA? (Cost & ROI Guide) - Electric Vehicle Charging Installations","url":"https://evci.com.au/is-a-home-ev-charger-worth-it-in-wa/"},{"title":"Horizon Power","url":"https://www.horizonpower.com.au/about-us/news-announcements/fees-and-charges-2025/"},{"title":"Synergy's Midday Saver Tariff: Home Batteries Can Pay in WA","url":"https://www.solarquotes.com.au/blog/synergy-midday-saver-review/"}]},"WA EV Network chargers cost **$0.60/kWh on DC fast chargers and $0.35/kWh on AC chargers**. You can pay with the Chargefox app, a credit card or an RFID card.\n\n**Pricing**\n- Horizon Power's current fees page gives the WA EV Network rates as AC Charger 0.35 cents/kWh, DC Charger 0.60 cents/kWh; Idle fee: not applicable (AC) / $1 per minute* once 100% charged (DC). The page says \"cents/kWh\", but that looks like a typo. It should be dollars, which matches the Synergy FAQ below.\n- Horizon Power's 2025 price notice says these fees were \"2025/26 Unchanged from last year\".\n- A Synergy/Shire of Northam FAQ from about 2024 said: \"For Synergy chargers, the price for the DC fast chargers will be $0.60p/Kwh and for the AC slow charger it will be $0.35p/Kwh.\" At that point the rate applied only to the South West grid (SWIS). Horizon Power were still working out pricing for the North West grid (NWIS). Horizon's page now lists the same rates.\n\n**How to pay**\n- Horizon Power: \"You'll be able to pay via the Chargefox app or credit card.\"\n- A Synergy construction notice for the Northam site lists \"Credit Card, RFI Card & Charge Phone App\" as payment options. The site has 1 × 150 kW DC charger and 1 × 22 kW AC charger.\n\n**Background**\n- The WA EV Network is a State Government initiative delivered by Synergy and Horizon Power. It is part of the State Government's $24.4 million Electric Vehicle Fund.\n\n**Gaps**\n- I didn't find any 2026/27 price update for the network. The newest pricing source is Horizon's fees page, indexed about 6 months ago.\n- None of the results came from Synergy's own current EV network page."],"durationSeconds":9.322429663000003,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LkMfWEJTtLHonzAy7DsHQG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RkvC285stxaPHvFdm5XU9Z","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Electric Highway Tasmania fast charger app payment\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/217292\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/523007\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/202314\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/473841\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/243112\"},{\"title\":\"Public fast chargers - payment methods\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/public-fast-chargers-payment-methods.196651/\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/247644\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/477293\"},{\"title\":\"Charging Electric Vehicles Tasmanian Fast Charger Network\",\"url\":\"https://www.aeva.asn.au/files/364/\"},{\"title\":\"Tasmanian Fast / Ultra Fast chargers\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/tasmanian-fast-ultra-fast-chargers.98249/page-4\"}]\n\nSearch results show that Electric Highway Tasmania (EHT) chargers are paid for mainly through **Chargefox**.\n\n**How to pay**\n- PlugShare listings for EHT sites mostly say to pay with the Chargefox app or a Chargefox card. Some sites also take credit cards, for example a 43 kW site where you can pay with the Chargefox App, Chargefox Card or Credit Card, and another where you can use the Chargefox app, or an RFID card linked to your Chargefox account, or credit card.\n- Several other sites list only the Chargefox App or Chargefox Card, so card readers may not be at every site.\n- A Tesla Motors Club post from about 5 years ago says EHT takes the Chargefox card or app but also direct credit card payment (Paypass/Paywave and presumably anything else using the same tech such as Apple Pay). Another forum post says EHT use Chargefox as a billing partner.\n- One practical tip: at one site, mobile reception is limited. Access free wifi to activate session via app.\n- The AEVA presentation describes the original site design as 1 x 50 kW DC fast charger (Tritium Veefil) • 1 x 22 kW, 3 phase AC charger... Connect and pay by Chargefox app, fleet card or credit card.\n\n**Pricing (old figures)**\nThe early AEVA presentation gave prices of 50 kW DC: 25 cents / minute + 25 cents / kWh. These are likely out of date.\n\n**Ownership**\nNRMA first announced a minority investment into Electric Highway Tasmania. A later source says NRMA owns all of the electric highway Tasmania's electric vehicle charging sites. It also says For real-time updates on individual chargers please check the Chargefox app.\n\n**Caveat:** Most of these sources are a few years old or are user-edited PlugShare listings. Since NRMA took over, payment may have moved to the NRMA app or changed in other ways. A follow-up search on NRMA's current payment setup for Tasmania would confirm it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c59389d-e35a-4c8f-bb09-2fcfce2e7e03","uuid":"bf366162-61e6-4dbc-af63-940ed0ab8917","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:30:11.960Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Electric Highway Tasmania fast charger app payment","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01RkexEDQ8Bu9XbsWGWJ6aDP","content":[{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/217292"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/523007"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/202314"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/473841"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/243112"},{"title":"Public fast chargers - payment methods","url":"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/public-fast-chargers-payment-methods.196651/"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/247644"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/477293"},{"title":"Charging Electric Vehicles Tasmanian Fast Charger Network","url":"https://www.aeva.asn.au/files/364/"},{"title":"Tasmanian Fast / Ultra Fast chargers","url":"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/tasmanian-fast-ultra-fast-chargers.98249/page-4"}]},"Search results show that Electric Highway Tasmania (EHT) chargers are paid for mainly through **Chargefox**.\n\n**How to pay**\n- PlugShare listings for EHT sites mostly say to pay with the Chargefox app or a Chargefox card. Some sites also take credit cards, for example a 43 kW site where you can pay with the Chargefox App, Chargefox Card or Credit Card, and another where you can use the Chargefox app, or an RFID card linked to your Chargefox account, or credit card.\n- Several other sites list only the Chargefox App or Chargefox Card, so card readers may not be at every site.\n- A Tesla Motors Club post from about 5 years ago says EHT takes the Chargefox card or app but also direct credit card payment (Paypass/Paywave and presumably anything else using the same tech such as Apple Pay). Another forum post says EHT use Chargefox as a billing partner.\n- One practical tip: at one site, mobile reception is limited. Access free wifi to activate session via app.\n- The AEVA presentation describes the original site design as 1 x 50 kW DC fast charger (Tritium Veefil) • 1 x 22 kW, 3 phase AC charger... Connect and pay by Chargefox app, fleet card or credit card.\n\n**Pricing (old figures)**\nThe early AEVA presentation gave prices of 50 kW DC: 25 cents / minute + 25 cents / kWh. These are likely out of date.\n\n**Ownership**\nNRMA first announced a minority investment into Electric Highway Tasmania. A later source says NRMA owns all of the electric highway Tasmania's electric vehicle charging sites. It also says For real-time updates on individual chargers please check the Chargefox app.\n\n**Caveat:** Most of these sources are a few years old or are user-edited PlugShare listings. Since NRMA took over, payment may have moved to the NRMA app or changed in other ways. A follow-up search on NRMA's current payment setup for Tasmania would confirm it."],"durationSeconds":10.556557953999997,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RkvC285stxaPHvFdm5XU9Z","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
