{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QmU8d4yKm8Q6nX2S9msU5U","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Woolworths fast EV chargers Dakabin Glen Huntly which network app\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Woolworths Glen Huntly\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/1148041\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/332597\"},{\"title\":\"PRESS RELEASE: EV drivers can now collect Everyday Rewards points when charging at Woolworths Supermarkets.\",\"url\":\"https://getthewordout.com.au/press-release/press-release-ev-drivers-can-now-collect-everyday-rewards-points-when-charging-at-woolworths-supermarkets/\"},{\"title\":\"Autel Chargers Now at IKEA and Woolworths Sites\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/autel-expands-charger-footprint-from-homes-to-the-largest-retailers-in-anz\"},{\"title\":\"Australian EV charging platform partners with retail giant's rewards program - The Driven IO\",\"url\":\"https://thedriven.io/2025/05/14/australian-ev-charging-platform-partners-with-retail-giants-rewards-program/\"},{\"title\":\"Public EV Charging\",\"url\":\"https://www.we-ev.co.nz/on-the-go\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - EV Charging Station Map - Find a place to charge your car!\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/740224\"},{\"title\":\"Chargefox partners with Woolworths Everyday Rewards points\",\"url\":\"https://www.propertycenterpiece.com.au/post/chargefox-partners-with-woolworths-everyday-rewards-points\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/496968\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/245098\"}]\n\nBoth stores' chargers are on the **Chargefox** network, and you start and pay for charging in the Chargefox app.\n\n- **Glen Huntly (VIC):** PlugShare lists Woolworths Glen Huntly at 1115-1129 Glen Huntly Rd as a Chargefox site. It has CCS2 4 Plugs 47 kW 2 Stations. Users there have reported charging speeds of about 44 kW and 26 kW. It's the only result that names Glen Huntly directly.\n- **Dakabin (QLD):** None of the results is a listing for this store, but it appears on the list of Woolworths charger sites in Queensland: Bannockburn, Bellmere, Dakabin, Doolandella, Gordonvale West, Logan Reserve, and Redbank Plains Mountview. The source says These chargers are all available on the Chargefox App. I didn't find the exact speed or number of plugs at Dakabin.\n- **Payment:** Customers pay through the Chargefox app, which is open to all EV drivers, not only Woolworths shoppers. The chargers are made by Autel, and Woolworths stores offer a mix of AC and DC charging options from as slow as 7kW AC to 200 kW DC.\n- **Rewards:** Everyday Rewards members who add their membership details to their Chargefox profile earn 1 point per $1 spent on charging.\n- **Speed sharing:** At one Woolworths site with two 47 kW Autel units, the speed is halved to about 23kW per car when two cars are connected. The Glen Huntly units may work the same way, but I couldn't confirm that.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c59389d-e35a-4c8f-bb09-2fcfce2e7e03","uuid":"bea1b8c3-ffdd-40c5-a86d-bbab2fb4fcf1","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:30:50.708Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Woolworths fast EV chargers Dakabin Glen Huntly which network app","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01K74CVK6Kpu8miDqWMGjTqw","content":[{"title":"Woolworths Glen Huntly","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/1148041"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/332597"},{"title":"PRESS RELEASE: EV drivers can now collect Everyday Rewards points when charging at Woolworths Supermarkets.","url":"ht