 app, which is open to all EV drivers, not only Woolworths shoppers. The chargers are made by Autel, and Woolworths stores offer a mix of AC and DC charging options from as slow as 7kW AC to 200 kW DC.\n- **Rewards:** Everyday Rewards members who add their membership details to their Chargefox profile earn 1 point per $1 spent on charging.\n- **Speed sharing:** At one Woolworths site with two 47 kW Autel units, the speed is halved to about 23kW per car when two cars are connected. The Glen Huntly units may work the same way, but I couldn't confirm that."],"durationSeconds":8.400574985999992,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QmU8d4yKm8Q6nX2S9msU5U","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011FoifDRuzoAtdDELZbHR17","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Exploren EV charging network price per kWh thedriven\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Best EV Charging Networks in Australia (2025)\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/resources/what-ev-charging-providers-are-in-australia\"},{\"title\":\"EV Charging Cost\",\"url\":\"https://myevjourney.com/2026/03/03/ev-charging-cost/\"},{\"title\":\"Exploren EV charging prices in Australia: rates and fees\",\"url\":\"https://costtocharge.com.au/public-charging-prices/exploren/\"},{\"title\":\"What Does It Cost to Charge an EV?\",\"url\":\"https://nexusautotransport.com/cost-to-charge-electric-car/\"},{\"title\":\"How much does it cost to run an EV versus a petrol car? - The Driven IO\",\"url\":\"https://thedriven.io/2024/11/27/how-much-does-it-cost-to-run-an-ev-versus-a-petrol-car/\"},{\"title\":\"EV Charging USA, INC - Form 424B3 - FY2015\",\"url\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001083383/000072174815000339/evus424b051515.htm\"},{\"title\":\"EV Charging USA, INC - Form S-1 - FY2015\",\"url\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001083383/000072174815000055/evus012315s1.htm\"},{\"title\":\"EV Charging USA, INC - Form 8-K/A - FY2014\",\"url\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001083383/000146396715000002/evus_8ka-1501.htm\"},{\"title\":\"EV Charging USA, INC - Form 10-K - FY2015\",\"url\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001083383/000155723415000332/evus10k110515.htm\"}]\n\nI didn't find a thedriven.io article about Exploren's pricing specifically. The useful results came from other Australian sources:\n\n**Exploren pricing (Australia):**\n- **Site owners set the prices, so they differ by location.** ZECAR (about a year old) says AC destination chargers generally cost $0.40–0.60/kWh and DC fast chargers $0.55–0.75/kWh.  Its summary line says AC ranges from free to $0.55/kWh.  In ZECAR's words, Exploren is a platform that connects drivers to charging sites owned by others. \n- **Size of the network:** ZECAR lists more than 493 locations and 5,500 plugs across public, fleet and apartment sites. \n- **Sample prices from costtocharge.com.au (undated):** Published standard DC prices on Exploren run from $0.35 to $0.70/kWh.  Examples include Toronto Commercial Centre Carpark in NSW at 35c/kWh , Kingston Village Square in Ocean Grove, VIC at 55c , Cairns Night Markets in QLD at 60c  and UTAS Shed Building in Launceston, TAS at 70c. \n- **Report from a driver (myevjourney.com, March 2026):** Their local Exploren 60kW DC charger costs 45c/kWh. \n\n**The Driven (thedriven.io):** The only hit was a running-cost article from November 2024 that doesn't mention Exploren. It uses generic public charging rates: 45c/kWh for AC, noting that \"many public AC chargers are still free,\" and 65c/kWh for DC. \n\nIf you specifically need The Driven's coverage of Exploren, try searching for something like \"Exploren thedriven.io\".\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c59389d-e35a-4c8f-bb09-2fcfce2e7e03","uuid":"b93f2bbf-0921-409f-a6ae-71b7dd0b5052","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:30:50.888Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Exploren EV charging network price per kWh thedriven","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01TdVHFDKBT557VDjhqBcvPc","content":[{"title":"Best EV Charging Networks in Australia (2025)","url":"https://zecar.com/resources/what-ev-charging-providers-are-in-australia"},{"title":"EV Charging Cost","url":"https://myevjourney.com/2026/03/03/ev-charging-cost/"},{"title":"Exploren EV charging prices in Australia: rates and fees","url":"https://costtocharge.com.au/public-charging-prices/exploren/"},{"title":"What Does It Cost to Charge an EV?","url":"https://nexusautotransport.com/cost-to-charge-electric-car/"},{"title":"How much does it cost to run an EV versus a petrol c