ny public AC chargers are still free,\" and 65c/kWh for DC. \n\nIf you specifically need The Driven's coverage of Exploren, try searching for something like \"Exploren thedriven.io\"."],"durationSeconds":9.129057453999994,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011FoifDRuzoAtdDELZbHR17","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
