{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WaxKjvN8AABhMWGiFTQXe6","type":"tool_result","content":"**Payment:** Drivers pay through the Wevolt app with a card. The page says \"Payment is handled in the app. A pre-authorisation hold is placed on your card, then you're billed for the energy used.\" It also says \"A temporary pre-authorisation hold verifies your card, then you pay only for the energy you use.\" That hold is described as \"a temporary pre-authorisation hold to verify your payment method. It's released after your session.\" The FAQ refers to it as a \"$25 charge.\" An RFID card is not required: \"a card is optional if you prefer tap-to-charge.\"\n\n**Who sets prices:** Independent operators, not Wevolt. The chargers are \"owned and run by independent operators\" who \"list them in the app and set their own prices.\" Some sites may also add idle fees: \"Some sites apply an idle fee if you stay plugged in after charging finishes.\"\n\n**Typical price per kWh:** The page gives no typical or standard per-kWh rate. The only figures appear in an app screenshot caption showing \"a 00:24:01 timer, 30 kWh, $8.55.\" That is an illustrative example, not a published price."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c59389d-e35a-4c8f-bb09-2fcfce2e7e03","uuid":"58b23776-a4f4-40e0-86ec-186ca3b547b8","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:31:05.929Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":33148,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Payment:** Drivers pay through the Wevolt app with a card. The page says \"Payment is handled in the app. A pre-authorisation hold is placed on your card, then you're billed for the energy used.\" It also says \"A temporary pre-authorisation hold verifies your card, then you pay only for the energy you use.\" That hold is described as \"a temporary pre-authorisation hold to verify your payment method. It's released after your session.\" The FAQ refers to it as a \"$25 charge.\" An RFID card is not required: \"a card is optional if you prefer tap-to-charge.\"\n\n**Who sets prices:** Independent operators, not Wevolt. The chargers are \"owned and run by independent operators\" who \"list them in the app and set their own prices.\" Some sites may also add idle fees: \"Some sites apply an idle fee if you stay plugged in after charging finishes.\"\n\n**Typical price per kWh:** The page gives no typical or standard per-kWh rate. The only figures appear in an app screenshot caption showing \"a 00:24:01 timer, 30 kWh, $8.55.\" That is an illustrative example, not a published price.","durationMs":4690,"url":"https://wevolt.com.au/drivers"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WaxKjvN8AABhMWGiFTQXe6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
