{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChAKWimyAsaSibC3JFWtz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0147P9PW8W8MKt5tVvUYRrBF","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/gh-aw/repo-memory/prices/operators.json","content":"[\n  {\"operator\": \"Yurika\", \"fastSites\": 49, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Owns/operates QESH; TMR names Chargefox as the CPO, councils (Goondiwindi, Winton) say pay via Chargefox app. Added 'yurika' to chargefox match. QESH DC 55c/kWh from 1 Mar 2024 (old).\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Queensland Electric Super Highway\", \"fastSites\": 6, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Same as Yurika; Chargefox app. Added to chargefox match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Exploren\", \"fastSites\": 33, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"added\", \"notes\": \"Added as network 'exploren', siteReading forbidden, price null (ZECAR says DC $0.55-0.75 range, costtocharge 4 sites $0.35-0.70; no typical figure).\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Charging the Regions\", \"fastSites\": 25, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"CVGA: Evie Networks contracted to operate and maintain the 23 fast sites. Added to evie match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"RAA\", \"fastSites\": 13, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"raa.com.au: RAA Charge runs on Chargefox app. Metro DC 66c off-peak/75c peak. Added 'raa' to chargefox match (short substring, watch for false hits).\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Electric Highway Tasmania\", \"fastSites\": 6, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"NRMA-owned, paid via Chargefox app/card/credit card. Added to chargefox match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Engie\", \"fastSites\": 5, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"alias\", \"notes\": \"ENGIE public chargers upgraded to Exploren platform (The Glen page); Chargefox still works at DC. Added 'engie' to exploren match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Woolworths\", \"fastSites\": 4, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Woolworths Autel chargers on Chargefox app (Everyday Rewards partnership). Added to chargefox match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"WA EV Network (AU)\", \"fastSites\": 4, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Synergy/Horizon Power; pay via Chargefox app or credit card; DC $0.60 (Horizon Power fees page via search; page 403 to fetch). Added 'wa ev network' to chargefox.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"WeVolt (AU)\", \"fastSites\": 4, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"added\", \"notes\": \"Added network 'wevolt', price null; operators set prices. robots.txt allows Claude-User; terms ambiguous -> unchecked.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"Electrona\", \"fastSites\": 4, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Tap-and-go card sites, Wevolt app as alternative; Bicheno DC $3/session + $0.64/kWh. Added to wevolt match.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"EV Highway (Horizon Power)\", \"fastSites\": 3, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"roaming\", \"notes\": \"Part of WA EV Network, Chargefox app. Added 'horizon power' to chargefox.\"},\n  {\"operator\": \"_priceNotes\", \"fastSites\": 0, \"firstSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"lastSeen\": \"2026-11-18\", \"decision\": \"pending\", \"notes\": \"Not an operator. 2026-11-18: Ampol 75c/kWh claimed by gridly.com.au (402 to fetch) and OzBargain users; not changed. mynrma.com.au and horizonpower.com.au return 403 to WebFetch. Evie FAQ has no per-kWh figu